scenario room lights switched on and left on: YIELD, then a scene change after 30 s (TP15)
room 0
boot
within 9 state == DARK_IDLE
hand 1
wait 3
room 20 white                  # lights on: a big broadband rise at the bat
within 1.0 level <= floor
expect state == YIELD
expect level == floor
wait 29
expect state == YIELD
expect pending > 0             # held aside: it might still be another light
within 1.5 state == LIT        # 30 s rule: re-baselined, the room is the room again (I9)
expect scene_changes == 1
expect event_fmm == 0          # the room's light was not charged; only the floor was
expect pending == 0
expect remaining > 0
wait 3
expect state == LIT
expect events == 1
